    "title": "Severe Thunderstorm Warning by NWS - NewsBreak",
    "text": "2 minutes ago Check NWS updates here\nEffective: 2025-09-03 21:29:00 PDT Expires: 2025-09-03 21:45:00 PDT Urgency: Immediate Severity: Severe Certainty: Observed Instruction: For your protection move to an interior room on the lowest floor of a building. Target Area: Maricopa, AZ; Pinal, AZ At 929 PM MST, a severe thunderstorm was located 8 miles southeast of Freeman, or 26 miles west of Casa Grande, and is nearly stationary.\nHAZARD...60 mph wind gusts.\nSOURCE...Radar indicated.\nIMPACT...Expect damage to roofs, siding, and trees.\nLocations impacted include... Freeman.\nThis includes AZ Interstate 8 between mile markers 140 and 152.",
